Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.57,0:00:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Violin's You
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.09,0:00:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.09,0:01:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.99,0:02:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.43,0:02:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.11,0:03:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.43,0:03:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.77,0:04:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you need? Horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.07,0:04:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Whole Horse, what is it you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.49,0:04:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.40,0:04:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,got a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.95,0:04:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A report?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.39,0:04:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy Polnareff, you see, he done\Ngone and defected to Joestar's outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.13,0:04:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear, whole horse,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.63,0:04:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,the actions Polnareff chooses are\Nof very little consequence to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.13,0:04:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, errand boys are easy to\Ncome by, wouldn't you say, whole horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.91,0:04:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You've wasted my time coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.19,0:04:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And my time is very valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.19,0:04:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now run along, you still have work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.89,0:05:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,First and foremost, do hurry up\Nwith the termination of the Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.57,0:05:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And this time, try not to disappoint me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.77,0:05:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you tell me to live\Nup to your expectations?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.79,0:05:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who do you think you are anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.97,0:05:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at you, sitting\Nthere with your back to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.93,0:05:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaving yourself wide open!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.83,0:05:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, everyone's just blowing\Nyour rip out of proportion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.37,0:05:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I never pledged eternal\Nloyalties to kiss my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.23,0:05:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Adios, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.85,0:05:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You can regret this moment in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.21,0:05:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.95,0:05:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.86,0:05:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,even at the moment of the kill,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.45,0:05:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,your breathing is measured\Nand you perspire very little.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.81,0:05:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad, whole horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.45,0:05:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.87,0:05:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.19,0:06:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How did he get behind me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.39,0:06:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.30,0:06:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.01,0:06:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.92,0:06:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.75,0:06:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I have a dream\Nlike that right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.25,0:06:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If we continue at the rate at\Nwhich we're currently traveling,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.41,0:06:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,we should make it to the Red\NSea in just a couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.35,0:07:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's where we are, and once we pass\Nright through there, we'll be in Egypt?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.11,0:07:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Every day we're getting closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.89,0:07:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to make you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.45,0:07:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, uh, Mr. Joestar. Who\Nis that you were talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.37,0:07:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh that was just my friend in Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.23,0:07:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, it's already been more\Nthan 30 days since we left Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.23,0:07:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to wait, so let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.81,0:07:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.69,0:07:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Little lady, you're more beautiful\Nand breathtaking than a desert rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.47,0:07:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Whole horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.15,0:08:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Heck, I never imagined that you, yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.15,0:08:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,would be the one to come all the way\Ndown here to meet with this old cowpoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.33,0:08:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, now don't you go\Nlooking at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.93,0:08:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If you and I were to become partners,\Nwell, hell, we'd be unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.29,0:08:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.27,0:08:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You are so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.17,0:08:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.43,0:08:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.35,0:08:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the name of hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.25,0:08:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So, why do you suppose you were\Nasked to come here homeless?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.61,0:08:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Dio has granted me this opportunity\Nto avenge the death of my son, J. Guile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.67,0:08:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Avenge him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.31,0:08:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you abandon J.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.35,0:08:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Guile and shamelessly\Nmake your way back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.87,0:08:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey now, just hold on there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.91,0:08:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.29,0:08:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,By the time I arrived, J.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.55,0:08:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Guile was already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.33,0:08:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop making excuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.23,0:09:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall atone for the\Ncrime of abandoning J.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.31,0:09:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Guile by your death!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.49,0:09:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You too must have heard rumors,\Nbut have never seen my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.59,0:09:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, let me show it to you, whole horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.93,0:09:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going to...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.77,0:09:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My stand. Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.77,0:09:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Justice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.77,0:09:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.87,0:09:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this? Mist?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.93,0:09:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, a mist of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.75,0:09:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Death?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.43,0:09:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.93,0:09:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, a clean hole has opened now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.03,0:09:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my stand, Justice,\Nis a stand of mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.87,0:10:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever wound this mist touches\Nwill end up with a hole like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.23,0:10:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Go dance with Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.23,0:10:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut this shit off or I get mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.83,0:10:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.79,0:10:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, when the mist enters the\Nhole, it turns you into a puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.43,0:10:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Die by your own stand, whole horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.27,0:10:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Justice prevails.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.59,0:11:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, are you able to\Nsee well enough to drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.21,0:11:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such a\Nthick blanket of fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.17,0:11:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's getting pretty\Nhard to see the road up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.67,0:11:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.65,0:11:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only about three o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.67,0:11:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.83,0:11:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's stop in the next town and\Nlook for a place to spend the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.61,0:11:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.83,0:11:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Something strange about this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.31,0:11:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.77,0:11:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This place gives me the creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.69,0:11:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.09,0:12:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.45,0:12:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No point in just standing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.19,0:12:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, let's go find a hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.25,0:12:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, doesn't anyone live in this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.85,0:12:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't even ask for directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.23,0:12:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone dumped a dead dog there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.15,0:12:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.69,0:12:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What a smell!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.31,0:12:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's someone now! Hey, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.41,0:12:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but we're looking for a hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.77,0:12:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we find a hotel with clean\Nbathrooms somewhere around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.23,0:12:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Really sorry to bother you while you're\Nnapping, but could you wake up for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.55,0:12:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.46,0:12:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.73,0:12:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he out on the street like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.05,0:12:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be an accident or a heart attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.63,0:12:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.83,0:12:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't think it's as simple\Nas some guy having a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.63,0:12:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you pull his hand\Nout where we can see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.71,0:12:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.69,0:12:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.23,0:13:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.01,0:13:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The gun is still warm, which means not\Nmuch time has passed since it was fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.45,0:13:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So he shot himself then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.65,0:13:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But where's the wound? Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.01,0:13:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a hole underneath this guy's\Nthroat the size of a ping-pong ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.51,0:13:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the cause of death?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.91,0:13:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So where's the blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.47,0:13:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A wound like that should\Nhave gushed blood like crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.33,0:13:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving a big pool all around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.37,0:13:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.45,0:13:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-that's not all. Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.01,0:13:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like it. Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.73,0:13:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to this dead body?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There are holes all over this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.49,0:13:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And not a trace of blood\Nfrom any of the wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.01,0:13:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was he killed this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.79,0:13:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there some meaning to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.95,0:13:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.91,0:13:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone tell me what the\Nhell is going on here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.73,0:13:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just calm down, Polar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.61,0:14:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, we have to get the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.43,0:14:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.85,0:14:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.97,0:14:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We need you to call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.45,0:14:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a man lying dead in the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.77,0:14:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.61,0:14:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.53,0:14:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.85,0:14:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.55,0:14:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, there's a dead man\Nover there in the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.03,0:14:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We need you to call the\Npolice as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.21,0:14:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.95,0:14:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.81,0:14:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you want me to\Nreport it to the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.57,0:14:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so itchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.07,0:14:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If you would, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.43,0:14:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd appreciate it if you'd hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.39,0:14:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.35,0:14:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There seems to be something very wrong\Nwith the people in this town, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.05,0:14:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm wondering if this could\Nbe the work of another stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.53,0:14:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.97,0:14:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.88,0:14:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but I have no idea what our\Npursuers would gain by murdering
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.23,0:15:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,an innocent man before we\Neven arrived in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't see the motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.45,0:15:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't ignore the\Npossibility, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.65,0:15:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,His death is just too damn weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.55,0:15:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Jostar-san, I have to agree with Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.35,0:15:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's right and there's a stand user\Nhiding here, we are in serious danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.95,0:15:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And in that case, we need to\Nget out of here right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.65,0:15:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you suggesting we try\Nto escape in this fog?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.21,0:15:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that is what I call suicidal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.29,0:15:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.89,0:15:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how the hell should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.37,0:15:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you, just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.81,0:15:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point of arguing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.65,0:15:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So it must be here, a dead person,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.75,0:15:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I have brought you the police. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.23,0:16:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad there are some normal\Npeople living in this town!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.07,0:16:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, so it seems, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.09,0:16:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,From what I see, I\Npresume you are travelers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.87,0:16:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But with this fog, I'm afraid it's\Ntoo dangerous to drive out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.03,0:16:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I happen to manage a nearby hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.73,0:16:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you'd find it a comfortable\Nplace to spend the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.03,0:16:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.94,0:16:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A total godsend!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.85,0:16:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.77,0:16:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.68,0:16:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We need a hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.95,0:16:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody, can we stay there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.99,0:16:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.90,0:16:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.87,0:16:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.93,0:16:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you two think about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.07,0:16:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My word, those police\Nofficers are certainly rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.33,0:16:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what's with that attitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.03,0:16:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd think there were dead bodies\Non every street corner around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.85,0:16:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.76,0:17:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, my dear guests, shall we get?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.53,0:17:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,going to the fog is very dense please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.91,0:17:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me so you don't\Nget lost hey old lady
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.25,0:17:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,wait up please don't\Nforget your Luggage we're
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.97,0:17:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving now are you\Nready anytime we're just
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.29,0:17:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,staying for one night So\Nwe don't have much luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.63,0:17:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, we have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.31,0:17:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.59,0:17:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, here, welcoming the party of four.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.69,0:17:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.73,0:17:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.85,0:17:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a little bit worried about what\Nkind of place that old hag would manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.65,0:17:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is a real find.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.89,0:17:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, so it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.33,0:17:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sign right here, Mr. Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.59,0:18:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Old lady, just now you used the\Nname Joestar to refer to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.99,0:18:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how do you know that name?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.47,0:18:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, my dear guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.99,0:18:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He was addressed earlier as Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.07,0:18:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Joestar by him,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.09,0:18:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,that gentleman right over\Nthere. Huh? Who, me? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.55,0:18:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I say that or didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.19,0:18:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.33,0:18:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, well, I... But no, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.73,0:18:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,At the time, I thought I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.71,0:18:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're the one who called him that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.79,0:18:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because I'm old,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.27,0:18:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,it doesn't mean you can treat me\Nlike I'm going senile, fanget.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.23,0:18:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.37,0:18:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sure I said that, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.31,0:18:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.45,0:18:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.21,0:18:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.31,0:18:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,because you didn't make yourself clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.51,0:18:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My fault, old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.33,0:18:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.37,0:19:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Enya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.28,0:19:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.85,0:19:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been staying with\Nus since yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.39,0:19:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.53,0:19:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I just thought it was unusual for\Na woman to be traveling by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.01,0:19:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a beautiful lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.31,0:19:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite a rare occurrence around here. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.07,0:19:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She's that beautiful a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.89,0:19:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm, I'd definitely love to\Nget well acquainted with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.19,0:19:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,In your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.75,0:19:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.97,0:19:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.61,0:19:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I regret to mention that only Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.23,0:19:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Palnareff's room will be\Non the second floor. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.37,0:19:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's really no problem at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.25,0:19:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I noticed\Nthat ever since we met,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.73,0:19:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,you've only been using your right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.67,0:19:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you don't mind, I'd like to ask,\NUm, is something wrong with your left?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.45,0:19:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my left hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.63,0:19:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I burned this hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.19,0:19:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I accidentally spilled hot water on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.59,0:20:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.99,0:20:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You really should be\Nmore careful, old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.57,0:20:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.97,0:20:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, I will be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.89,0:20:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that about earlier, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.03,0:20:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't tell who might be an enemy,\Nso I thought I'd ask a trick question.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.45,0:20:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, and?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.93,0:20:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since we arrived in this town,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.13,0:20:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had this feeling that\Nwe're constantly being watched.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.63,0:20:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.57,0:20:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A woman from Egypt, a dead body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.55,0:20:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Too much of a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.43,0:20:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, room 303.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.79,0:20:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this one is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.97,0:20:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's talk tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.47,0:20:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.91,0:20:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This bed sure is more\Ncomfortable than that damn truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.27,0:21:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.47,0:21:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is up with that\Nold woman's bandage left hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.87,0:21:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.41,0:21:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I definitely need a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.51,0:21:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.33,0:21:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that must be the hottie the old\Nwoman in the hotel was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.35,0:22:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Barkeep, let's make it two.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.21,0:22:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,A whiskey for me and another\Nfor the lady while you're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.63,0:22:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The name is Jean-Pierre Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.79,0:22:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you here on a sightseeing\Ntrip with friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.99,0:22:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Or might you be traveling alone, looking\Nfor someone to spend some time with?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.29,0:22:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.19,0:22:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Enya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.69,0:22:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.73,0:22:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like we've\Nentered a city of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.67,0:22:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.09,0:23:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No one there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.47,0:23:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Felt like someone was watching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.79,0:23:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm traveling in search of a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.21,0:23:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, I'd be happy to\Nhelp you in any way I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.87,0:23:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.45,0:23:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.35,0:23:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.26,0:23:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What are the chances?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.17,0:23:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been out traveling on the\Nroad looking for a killer, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.59,0:23:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.27,0:23:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been searching for someone\Nwho brutally murdered my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.97,0:23:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.27,0:24:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.81,0:24:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.23,0:24:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, somebody, some sick bastard\Nmurdered my younger sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.15,0:24:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help you find that killer, Enya.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.05,0:24:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.41,0:24:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.59,0:24:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Whole Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.97,0:24:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.43,0:24:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.95,0:24:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this guy's problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.33,0:24:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got nothing against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.95,0:24:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Something really strange is going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.75,0:24:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That bartender is no ordinary human.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.45,0:25:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was he trying to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.51,0:25:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Miss Enya?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.73,0:25:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't finish my story yet, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.75,0:25:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But you see, I've actually\Nalready found the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.01,0:25:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the man who was dead in\Nthe middle of the street today.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.41,0:25:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw your wounds with my own two eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.81,0:25:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it you can still be alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.57,0:25:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The killer is you, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.13,0:25:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You have been a thorn in\Nthe sight of Lord Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.25,0:25:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And you are the killer of my son, J. Gile.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.65,0:25:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Your son?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.99,0:25:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave birth to that murdering bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.73,0:25:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it you've got your\Nown special kind of stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.43,0:25:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There can only be one stand per person.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.79,0:26:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But you see, my stand of the mist, the\Nstand of justice, controls the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.65,0:26:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hundreds and thousands are at my disposal\Nto do as I say, the moment I say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.99,0:26:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,See how my beloved clamor for\Nyour attention, Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.43,0:26:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And since they're already\Ndead, you can't kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.45,0:26:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.87,0:26:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you kill my\Nprecious son, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.39,0:26:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You will pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.45,0:26:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Die a slow and painful death. Pull around.
